        "description": "<p><span>\n\nThere are a lot of great musicians who don't live near you, and if you\nhold your dance on a Saturday it's much harder to put together a tour\nthat brings them to you.  Consider a Friday evening or Sunday\nafternoon, or even a weekly evening slot?\n\n</span>\n\n<p>\n\nLooking at the 330 contra dances tracked by <a href=\"https://www.trycontra.com/\">TryContra</a>, which I think is just\nabout all of them, there's a very clear scheduling pattern:\n\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\n<a highlight href=\"https://www.jefftk.com/contra-dances-by-day-of-week-big.png\"><img src=\"https://www.jefftk.com/contra-dances-by-day-of-week.png\" alt=\"Mon 12; Tue 7; Wed 15; Thr 10; Fri 71; Sat 187; Sun 28\" width=\"550\" height=\"440\" class=\"mobile-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:100.0vw; max-height:80.0vw;\" srcset=\"https://www.jefftk.com/contra-dances-by-day-of-week.png 550w,https://www.jefftk.com/contra-dances-by-day-of-week-2x.png 1100w\"><div style=\"height:min(80.0vw, 440px)\" class=\"image-vertical-spacer\"></div></a>\n\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\nThere a",
